It's certainly not woth the effort for a few more points of AC. You're 
set for ascension already.

Polypiling blank scrolls doesn't really work. They have a large chance 
of staying blank. It's better to polypile regular scrolls. If you have 
create monster, just start calling in baddies and let your army devour 
them; you should get plenty of scrolls. But even that's not really worth it.

If I were you I'd just genocide the more annoying baddies. If you really 
want to reverse genocide something, try cockatrices (with extreme 
caution); if you've got an icebox then the corpses will be great to 
have. If you're bored (and I bet you are after 40000 turns...), call in 
some nymphs and have fun tracking down all of your items again. :)

You bless items with holy water, I'm sure you've realized that. If you 
want to do the opposite of bless, maybe you should use the opposite of 
holy water...

